  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Keep every tool that is not a list, get, report or dashboard on review: they change live campaigns, ads, bids, budgets, assets and Merchant Center feeds, and bid or budget changes spend real money.",
    "Read the account with google_ads_execute_gaql, the google_ads_list_* and google_ads_get_* tools, reports and dashboards; they never change it.",
    "google_ads_create_reviewed_search_campaign creates Search campaigns PAUSED and validate-only by default; review its plan before turning validate_only off.",
    "Sign the OAuth refresh token in with a Google user that has Standard, not Admin, access and keep .env (developer and refresh tokens) at chmod 600.",
    "Try changes on a Google Ads test account first: a developer token with Test access works only with test accounts."
  ]
